F1 "WemosDecatron-rescue_TEST_1P-4DigitIN12Main-rescue-4DigitIN12Main-rescue" 0 200 50 H V C CNN
F2 "" 200 0 50 H I C CNN
F3 "" 200 0 50 H I C CNN
DRAW
C 0 130 30 0 1 0 N
X 1 1 0 0 100 U 50 50 1 1 P
ENDDRAW
ENDDEF
